[Applause]  [Music]  give me one minute and i'll show you how  dataflow can help you  process and enrich data at scale data is  generated in real time from different  sources but capturing processing and  analyzing it is not  easy because it's usually not in the  desired format for your downstream  systems  solution data flow dataflow is a  serverless fast and cost-effective data  processing service for stream and batch  data which removes operational overhead  by automating the infrastructure  provisioning  and auto scaling as your data grows  using dataflow  is easy you read the data from a source  transform it  and write it back into a sink it  provides portability  with the processing pipeline created  using open source apache beam libraries  in the language of your choice and  deploying it as  data flow job which then executes the  processing on worker virtual machines  you can create and run data flow jobs  using the cloud console ui  gcloud cli or the apis you can use  pre-built or custom templates  or write sql statements to develop  pipelines right from bigquery ui  or use ai platform notebooks security is  taken care  of with all the data encrypted at rest  and in transit  with an option to use customer managed  encryption keys  additionally you can use private ips and  vpc service controls to secure the  environment  for all these reasons dataflow is a  great choice for use cases such as  real-time ai  data warehousing or stream analytics so  next time you're looking to process and  enrich any data  take a minute to look at data flow to  learn more check out cloud.google.com  dataflow  [Music]

